# AI-Proxy
# Policy: Proxy
# Last reviewed: 2026-10-22
# Scope: international AI services, APIs, coding assistants and generators.
# OpenAI-specific rules are maintained separately in OpenAI-Proxy.list.
# Google AI rules (Gemini, AI Studio, NotebookLM, Jules, Antigravity, Stitch, DeepMind)
# are maintained separately in GoogleAI.list.
# Mainland China AI providers belong in AI-Direct.list.
# Shared infrastructure uses scoped domains or hosts, not cloud ASNs or IPs.
# This is a routing list, not an exhaustive firewall allowlist.

# Microsoft / Copilot
# https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/Microsoft-Copilot/connecting-microsoft-copilot-to-other-services
# https://learn.microsoft.com/copilot/overview
# https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/fundamentals-what-is-copilot-studio
DOMAIN,api.msn.com
DOMAIN,api.statsig.com
DOMAIN,assets.msn.com
DOMAIN,copilot.cloud.microsoft
DOMAIN,copilot.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,copilotstudio.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoft.net
DOMAIN,gateway.bingviz.microsoftapp.net
DOMAIN,location.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,m365.cloud.microsoft
DOMAIN,odc.officeapps.live.com
DOMAIN,r.bing.com
DOMAIN,self.events.data.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,services.bingapis.com
DOMAIN,static.cloudflareinsights.com
DOMAIN,sydney.bing.com
DOMAIN,www.bing.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bing-shopping.microsoft-falcon.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,edgeservices.bing.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m365copilot.com

# GitHub Copilot
# https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/copilot-allowlist-reference
DOMAIN,api.github.com
DOMAIN,avatars.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,collector.github.com
DOMAIN,copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,copilot-telemetry.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,default.exp-tas.com
DOMAIN,github.com
DOMAIN,github.githubassets.com
DOMAIN,origin-tracker.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com

# Anthropic / Claude / Claude Code / Cowork / MCP Apps
# Core suffixes include API, Console, OAuth, docs, support, updates and assets.
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop#network-access-requirements
# https://claude.com/docs/connectors/building/mcp-apps/getting-started
# https://claude.com/docs/claude-science/network-requirements
DOMAIN,servd-anthropic-website.b-cdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com

# Short links: https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-community
# Developer site: https://claude.dev/
# Artifact links: Claude Code 2.1.292 artifact-URL classifier.
# MCP client frame: https://claude.site/ Content-Security-Policy; registrar
# RDAP lists Anthropic PBC: https://rdap.markmonitor.com/rdap/domain/CLAUDEMCPCLIENT.COM
# Binary cross-check: https://downloads.claude.ai/claude-code-releases/2.1.292/manifest.json

# Anthropic-specific production endpoints on partner infrastructure.
# https://claude.com/docs/government/deploy-desktop/configure
# https://docs.cloud.google.com/organization-policy/reference/restrict-services-supported-services
# https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-platform-on-aws
# The two Government hosts are also in Claude Code 2.1.292's gateway allowlist.
DOMAIN,claude.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.fedstart.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.palantirfedstart.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,aws-external-anthropic.*.api.aws

# Claude Code feature flags: exact shared host from the verified 2.1.292 binary.
DOMAIN,cdn.growthbook.io

# xAI / Grok
# Cursor shares these authentication hosts; avoid proxying all of spacex.ai.
